WEBVTT

00:00:00.456 --> 00:00:04.142
Namaste. Is video mein do roz ke kaam dekhenge.

00:00:04.142 --> 00:00:09.083
Pehla, customer ko WhatsApp par poora bill aur uska PDF bhejna.

00:00:09.083 --> 00:00:15.827
Doosra, shaam ko galla ginna, yaani din band karna. Ye public demo dummy data par hai.

00:00:16.218 --> 00:00:24.062
Pehle ek chhota bill banate hain. Existing customer chunte hain, taaki unka phone number bill ke saath rahe.

00:00:24.062 --> 00:00:26.749
Ek item jodte hain aur Complete bill.

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:34.164
Fully paid aur Generate invoice. Bill ban gaya.

00:00:34.164 --> 00:00:41.291
Ab dekhiye upar teen kaam: WhatsApp par bill bhejna, PDF save karna, aur PDF share karna.

00:00:41.663 --> 00:00:47.863
Send invoice on WhatsApp dabane par customer ke number par poora bill jaata hai.

00:00:47.863 --> 00:00:55.381
Har item, rate, GST ka hisaab, total, kitna diya aur kitna baaki, aur neeche Invoice PDF ka link.

00:00:55.381 --> 00:01:03.674
Pehle sirf total jaata tha, ab poora bill jaata hai. Share PDF se PDF file hi WhatsApp par bhej sakte hain.

00:01:04.049 --> 00:01:10.316
Customer jab wo link kholta hai, to use ye page dikhta hai. Bina login ke, sirf usi bill ka.

00:01:10.316 --> 00:01:17.740
Yahan se wo PDF download kar sakta hai. Link ko koi guess nahi kar sakta, isliye doosre bill safe rehte hain.

00:01:28.668 --> 00:01:31.952
Ab shaam ka kaam. Daily summary kholte hain.

00:01:31.952 --> 00:01:37.700
Sabse upar Expected cash in drawer, yaani galle mein kitna cash hona chahiye.

00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:48.299
Isme cash bikri, udhaar vasooli aur advance judte hain, aur kharid, vendor ko payment, chhote kharche, staff ki salary aur refund ghatte hain.

00:01:48.299 --> 00:01:52.479
Jis din kharid zyada ho, ye minus mein bhi ho sakta hai.

00:01:53.386 --> 00:01:59.891
Neeche Close the day ka card hai. Subah galle mein kitna tha, wo Opening cash mein likhte hain.

00:01:59.891 --> 00:02:05.917
App bata raha hai din bhar mein cash kitna badla, aur galle mein kul kitna hona chahiye.

00:02:06.287 --> 00:02:12.511
Ab note ginte hain. Paanch sau ke kitne, do sau ke kitne, sau ke kitne, aur sikke.

00:02:12.511 --> 00:02:19.418
Jaise-jaise likhte hain, app counted jodta jaata hai aur batata hai kitna kam ya zyada hai.

00:02:19.791 --> 00:02:26.091
Kuch cash bank mein jama karna hai ya ghar le jaana hai, to Cash taken out mein likhiye.

00:02:26.091 --> 00:02:32.033
App batata hai kal ke liye galle mein kitna bachega, wahi kal ka opening cash hoga.

00:02:32.033 --> 00:02:36.042
Kam ya zyada ho to note likh dijiye, phir Close the day.

00:02:36.421 --> 00:02:37.725
Din band ho gaya.

00:02:37.725 --> 00:02:46.545
Card par sab likha hai: opening, din ka badlaav, kitna hona chahiye, kitna gina, fark, aur kal ke liye kitna bacha.

00:02:46.545 --> 00:02:54.752
Neeche pichhle dino ka record bhi hai. Galti ho gayi ho to owner din dobara khol kar phir se gin sakta hai.

00:02:55.121 --> 00:03:04.711
To aaj humne dekha: bill banate hi WhatsApp par poora bill aur PDF, customer ka apna invoice link, aur shaam ko galla gin kar din band karna.

00:03:04.711 --> 00:03:10.492
Roz ka ye do minute ka kaam mahine ke ant ke bade jhagdon se bachata hai. Dhanyavaad.
